      "html": "Topic: Dependency Injection (DI) and Dependency Inversion Principle (DIP)",
      "text": "Topic: Dependency Injection (DI) and Dependency Inversion Principle (DIP)"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f78db0ffb41b477789",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Focus: What they are, how they differ, why “inversion” is used, and how higher/lower relates to inner/outer",
      "text": "Focus: What they are, how they differ, why “inversion” is used, and how higher/lower relates to inner/outer"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480e9bef3cfd18e7ca398",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Scope: Backend architecture, layered systems, Clean Architecture",
      "text": "Scope: Backend architecture, layered systems, Clean Architecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480fbbcf1d54d2c81beb6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Why this matters: Prevents tight coupling, improves testability, enables scalable system design",
      "text": "Why this matters: Prevents tight coupling, improves testability, enables scalable system design"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480bcae17d0596a800a1a",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548031aa0ce7f6bf70dcc2",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "1. Dependency Injection (DI)",
      "text": "1. Dependency Injection (DI)"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480b6b064e529238a4c8a",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "What It Is",
      "text": "What It Is"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ada636f799eb3c66a0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "A technique / pattern",
      "text": "A technique / pattern"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54803fae64cfc146b02c21",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Concerned with how objects receive their dependencies",
      "text": "Concerned with how objects receive their dependencies"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f4a911c90048634fcc",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Solves object construction and wiring problems",
      "text": "Solves object construction and wiring problems"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548016be05e752b062d2e5",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "It does NOT define architectural direction.",
      "text": "It does NOT define architectural direction."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54800c981ee96736d72743",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f3a795dc9067b33a52",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "Without Dependency Injection",
      "text": "Without Dependency Injection"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54801dba93fd5e2732e4fd",
      "type": "code",
      "html": "<span class=\"token keyword notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">class</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Service</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">:</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">\n    </span><span class=\"token keyword notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">def</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> </span><span class=\"token function notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">(</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">self</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">:</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">\n        self</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">.</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">repo </span><span class=\"token operator notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">=</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> Repository</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">)</span><span>\n</span>",
      "text": "class Service:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.repo = Repository()\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480119ecbef7fea579603",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Problems:",
      "text": "Problems:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548007b759fdab96d652e5",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Hard-coded dependency",
      "text": "Hard-coded dependency"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548084963efe9dd1ec901a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Tight coupling",
      "text": "Tight coupling"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809787c1de7822a5030d",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Difficult to test",
      "text": "Difficult to test"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548034b42fcf318425a2df",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Cannot swap implementation easily",
      "text": "Cannot swap implementation easily"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ebbd95f40bd9b2151f",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ff890aea0855662561",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "With Dependency Injection",
      "text": "With Dependency Injection"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804bbe72dc7d7f501e5c",
      "type": "code",
      "html": "<span class=\"token keyword notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">class</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Service</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">:</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">\n    </span><span class=\"token keyword notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">def</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> </span><span class=\"token function notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">(</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">self</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">,</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> repo</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">:</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">\n        self</span><span class=\"token punctuation notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">.</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">repo </span><span class=\"token operator notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">=</span><span class=\" notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> repo</span><span>\n</span>",
      "text": "class Service:\n    def __init__(self, repo):\n        self.repo = repo\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480648267ffca345fea51",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Effects:",
      "text": "Effects:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54807d942af25f8f425af4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Dependency is provided from outside",
      "text": "Dependency is provided from outside"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480dc9a66db7a6a461bd0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Easier testing (mock injection)",
      "text": "Easier testing (mock injection)"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c69791cd050481638d",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Looser coupling",
      "text": "Looser coupling"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d1b49bddc6aa7410bd",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "More flexible architecture",
      "text": "More flexible architecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480008182fda1b364e7f7",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480fab5bffb6625f6c68e",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "What DI Actually Solves",
      "text": "What DI Actually Solves"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54805d91afe24f76c7622c",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Construction-level coupling",
      "text": "Construction-level coupling"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a4aa17e2e6c3e805b9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Object creation responsibility",
      "text": "Object creation responsibility"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d49d6bc9bf010e8312",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Swapping implementations",
      "text": "Swapping implementations"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809f9334e96248cdd76f",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "DI answers:",
      "text": "DI answers:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54808e9257c26a995abb36",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "“How does this object get what it depends on?”",
      "text": "“How does this object get what it depends on?”"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54800eb9e1c4fd1c991a7a",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54802c9267ee96608d9303",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "2. Dependency Inversion Principle (DIP)",
      "text": "2. Dependency Inversion Principle (DIP)"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480949a1de0fb785a06d4",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "What It Is",
      "text": "What It Is"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c68bb8cc4dd1216b00",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "A design principle",
      "text": "A design principle"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480df842cd1290b6c1dc0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Part of SOLID",
      "text": "Part of SOLID"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d1b6a0e58da6f8c01f",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Governs architectural dependency direction",
      "text": "Governs architectural dependency direction"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54802eb0f4c2205423f6a3",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "It does NOT describe how objects are constructed.",
      "text": "It does NOT describe how objects are constructed."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d68a98e7f7ee2fc684",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548077a487fb94cfa20297",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "The Principle States",
      "text": "The Principle States"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d0ba30fa47c06574c7",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "High-level modules should not depend on low-level modules",
      "text": "High-level modules should not depend on low-level modules"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480bb89f0c427817024cd",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Both should depend on abstractions",
      "text": "Both should depend on abstractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c5a53dd083eaa32a42",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Abstractions should not depend on details",
      "text": "Abstractions should not depend on details"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54806d9d14cd63dd03b8ea",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Details should depend on abstractions",
      "text": "Details should depend on abstractions"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480daa27efed1a93021f9",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54803bb0f2ea6b22917581",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "Traditional Dependency Direction",
      "text": "Traditional Dependency Direction"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480e0a1eccedf0f2250af",
      "type": "code",
      "html": "OrderService → MySQLRepository",
      "text": "OrderService → MySQLRepository"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d29fc1d347232a28d6",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Meaning:",
      "text": "Meaning:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f4ab8beea2580614d8",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Business logic depends on database detail",
      "text": "Business logic depends on database detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54807f8267f54765b747f4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "If database changes, service changes",
      "text": "If database changes, service changes"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804e8428c69b67b2a7a4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Policy depends on implementation",
      "text": "Policy depends on implementation"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54808aabb3e9fbe5d9132d",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "This is the default direction in many systems.",
      "text": "This is the default direction in many systems."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ad9c39cd112765ebb9",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480da9c30e6074ff36783",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "After Applying DIP",
      "text": "After Applying DIP"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480caaa17eb5fb90013bb",
      "type": "code",
      "html": "OrderService → RepositoryInterface\nMySQLRepository → RepositoryInterface",
      "text": "OrderService → RepositoryInterface\nMySQLRepository → RepositoryInterface"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ada87bea2f1413bf40",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Now:",
      "text": "Now:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54803594e8c2eeac8eb709",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Service depends on abstraction",
      "text": "Service depends on abstraction"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480b0a119d97353630afe",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Implementation depends on abstraction",
      "text": "Implementation depends on abstraction"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480aa8835f927701b9544",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Concrete detail depends upward",
      "text": "Concrete detail depends upward"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804681f2d2dde5ae9ea4",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f2b8eac79a21eeb475",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "Why It Is Called “Inversion”",
      "text": "Why It Is Called “Inversion”"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804db29afda01f253617",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Control flow still goes:",
      "text": "Control flow still goes:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54800b99c6d7d0f925c12b",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Service → Repository",
      "text": "Service → Repository"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548074b119de09b49163f9",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "But dependency direction changes.",
      "text": "But dependency direction changes."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480fbabe7c8f516972a4c",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Instead of:",
      "text": "Instead of:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480efb172d051a01cb2af",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "High-level → Low-level",
      "text": "High-level → Low-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a5a2dec3114336857a",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "It becomes:",
      "text": "It becomes:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548008ada3f3ba7cdf773e",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Low-level → Abstraction ← High-level",
      "text": "Low-level → Abstraction ← High-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f7a32ef279b570acc8",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "The dependency direction is reversed from the traditional model.",
      "text": "The dependency direction is reversed from the traditional model."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548086ab72d4f5aa315b44",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "That reversal is the “inversion”.",
      "text": "That reversal is the “inversion”."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548043b9fad0e577fa43b8",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "If nothing changed structurally, it would just be dependency.",
      "text": "If nothing changed structurally, it would just be dependency."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a1a30af9d39e05076a",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "The term highlights that the direction was flipped.",
      "text": "The term highlights that the direction was flipped."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c8ba22ca1d1e29247c",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548018bff4f1f83787db98",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "3. Relationship Between DI and DIP",
      "text": "3. Relationship Between DI and DIP"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54802ca48af90c21fca775",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "They are related but not the same.",
      "text": "They are related but not the same."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480e79a2fcc9465b8c055",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Dependency Injection:",
      "text": "Dependency Injection:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480f99336f083bd916582",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Technique",
      "text": "Technique"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480228277e97ae5b36649",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Construction-level",
      "text": "Construction-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54808d978bedd91c8c4117",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Runtime wiring",
      "text": "Runtime wiring"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54808f9cc2f0df57baaae5",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Dependency Inversion:",
      "text": "Dependency Inversion:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480afa822e4c1c92a4fa1",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Principle",
      "text": "Principle"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54807ebe24dce899f6e0d4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Architectural-level",
      "text": "Architectural-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548092a515e031d0a74016",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Compile-time structure",
      "text": "Compile-time structure"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54803e9dbae9255194cf18",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Important:",
      "text": "Important:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ef945cf562d11b69cf",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "DIP defines structure",
      "text": "DIP defines structure"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480759ae0d1a93da651d6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "DI helps implement DIP",
      "text": "DI helps implement DIP"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54805a99dee8aebc823383",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "You can follow DIP without a DI framework",
      "text": "You can follow DIP without a DI framework"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480828b5dc31d85eca098",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "You cannot realistically implement DIP without injecting dependencies somehow",
      "text": "You cannot realistically implement DIP without injecting dependencies somehow"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480cd8703f4a285d882c5",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548014ae21f5b6fa64a463",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "4. What Makes Service Layer a Higher-Level Module",
      "text": "4. What Makes Service Layer a Higher-Level Module"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c998fad83fa8ab7653",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Higher-level does NOT mean:",
      "text": "Higher-level does NOT mean:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54808e9a5ee3f02c8e2563",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "More code",
      "text": "More code"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480508d56f0bac7f896f4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Higher folder placement",
      "text": "Higher folder placement"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809f8ddbe99494230984",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Executed earlier",
      "text": "Executed earlier"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548001a12dd4d820c73960",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Higher-level means:",
      "text": "Higher-level means:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54801a89e9dfedbc89580e",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "More abstract",
      "text": "More abstract"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480558c2cf39fa9a427d9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Defines business policy",
      "text": "Defines business policy"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480908643e00e80a2bcb9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Independent of technical detail",
      "text": "Independent of technical detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480cfa2daf7524f00a403",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480899bc6ff1b02632287",
      "type": "sub_header",
