      "html": "REST → gRPC",
      "text": "REST → gRPC"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c881bed5e5d1643cb1",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "The service logic should remain unchanged.",
      "text": "The service logic should remain unchanged."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ce82b3c8a2d7172b2e",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "That makes it higher-level.",
      "text": "That makes it higher-level."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480fea9edf1f512085c7e",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480e4a625d6300f91d00a",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "The Real Test",
      "text": "The Real Test"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480d58dc2f9f5dc39f137",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Ask:",
      "text": "Ask:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548091be67e7db770783bd",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "“If I change the database, should this module change?”",
      "text": "“If I change the database, should this module change?”"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548018b760fb60ab9fa95e",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "If yes → lower-level",
      "text": "If yes → lower-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804a9c88dad85994b1f4",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "If no → higher-level",
      "text": "If no → higher-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548071b175cf5e4fc58cda",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Service layer usually passes this test.",
      "text": "Service layer usually passes this test."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480cdab0add51da7d8568",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804c8e31dd3a2da5acfb",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "5. Higher vs Lower",
      "text": "5. Higher vs Lower"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54802c8ba7ec2759f688bf",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "This describes abstraction level.",
      "text": "This describes abstraction level."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548056b3acce76b1ec38e9",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Higher-level module:",
      "text": "Higher-level module:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480dea6cedc19de56b99a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "More abstract",
      "text": "More abstract"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809394d3dc55c16d7ff9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Policy-driven",
      "text": "Policy-driven"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548050a646e696348fcc15",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Stable",
      "text": "Stable"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804db4b2daad6c8397dd",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Independent of detail",
      "text": "Independent of detail"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548076a00fc749849484aa",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Lower-level module:",
      "text": "Lower-level module:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480be9478ea0110736dd7",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Concrete",
      "text": "Concrete"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548016aea5c31698fc46ab",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Technical implementation",
      "text": "Technical implementation"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548002a9c3fd98c2164814",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Framework-dependent",
      "text": "Framework-dependent"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a09afac224ab9d79c8",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Changes often",
      "text": "Changes often"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480cfba42faa677eceacd",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "This is conceptual hierarchy.",
      "text": "This is conceptual hierarchy."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54807fb651c899a3aec028",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480e4854bc3451d0e3fa8",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "6. Inner vs Outer (Clean Architecture)",
      "text": "6. Inner vs Outer (Clean Architecture)"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480909b46f71b4dedd927",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "This describes architectural position.",
      "text": "This describes architectural position."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480219751e00a9382b0d8",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Inner layer:",
      "text": "Inner layer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54800cbaa2dcab3fbeaf9a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Domain entities",
      "text": "Domain entities"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548067ac4ff8ae4c716cf1",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Core business rules",
      "text": "Core business rules"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54805baf33dd782295fcc0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Most stable",
      "text": "Most stable"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480aaba10edce5cbb9beb",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Outer layer:",
      "text": "Outer layer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480088cd9c11aaeb4779c",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Controllers",
      "text": "Controllers"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480b48538ec31445a4fb0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Frameworks",
      "text": "Frameworks"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54801aa229d9d5c09a4906",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Databases",
      "text": "Databases"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809a9bd7e2a4fbb8062c",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "UI",
      "text": "UI"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548036a039f0d8cfd123ad",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "This describes dependency layout.",
      "text": "This describes dependency layout."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ab84a7fb834a06fbc8",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548081ab50cfd4d9c0bafb",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "7. Do Higher/Lower and Inner/Outer Mean the Same?",
      "text": "7. Do Higher/Lower and Inner/Outer Mean the Same?"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548080800ad380438da79d",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "They describe different axes.",
      "text": "They describe different axes."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a283bad6b0b0bbecd3",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Higher/Lower → Abstraction",
      "text": "Higher/Lower → Abstraction"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548027aecbd107fa8e5dd0",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Inner/Outer → Diagram position",
      "text": "Inner/Outer → Diagram position"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54804684b7f71fd1e0d96c",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "However, in Clean Architecture they align:",
      "text": "However, in Clean Architecture they align:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809e9802cec968bcfc55",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Inner = Higher-level",
      "text": "Inner = Higher-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809b8d94c2a168425326",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Outer = Lower-level",
      "text": "Outer = Lower-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480819e0be377d526e161",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Dependencies must point inward:",
      "text": "Dependencies must point inward:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ec8939c4d8fb89afd5",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Outer → Inner",
      "text": "Outer → Inner"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548053b9e8f0f8bd52c240",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Never:",
      "text": "Never:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480ee8b08e1306f9fde0e",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Inner → Outer",
      "text": "Inner → Outer"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548038b6b2cb3d3027418e",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54807abd06c26dbd8b0ece",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "8. Clear Mapping in Backend Architecture",
      "text": "8. Clear Mapping in Backend Architecture"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54802c97c7f5a7ee8960a2",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Domain Layer:",
      "text": "Domain Layer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a2a698fd54dde542ab",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Inner",
      "text": "Inner"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548024ad68c321c1d647b9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Higher-level",
      "text": "Higher-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480afa94bc2761f1af3e9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Pure business logic",
      "text": "Pure business logic"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480bd99bff3a8f8fdafde",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Application / Service Layer:",
      "text": "Application / Service Layer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54806f9407c3eb3451f3d6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Inner",
      "text": "Inner"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548045b91dece2e428c96a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Higher-level",
      "text": "Higher-level"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54807fab5ef154db5027bf",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Orchestrates use cases",
      "text": "Orchestrates use cases"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809882e6f1e039b0a2a4",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Infrastructure Layer:",
      "text": "Infrastructure Layer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548019a008d8f5fb128bc8",
