    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54806aa676f0ca8b6db464",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "9. Common Confusions",
      "text": "9. Common Confusions"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548033a7ebc706cf2e2efe",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Confusion 1: DI and DIP are the same",
      "text": "Confusion 1: DI and DIP are the same"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54801a942ef7d60052d5c6",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Incorrect. One is a principle, the other a technique.",
      "text": "Incorrect. One is a principle, the other a technique."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480079161e09ea3ebbb4a",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Confusion 2: Higher means top of folder structure",
      "text": "Confusion 2: Higher means top of folder structure"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480998b33eb2d5a8aa9e6",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Incorrect. It means higher abstraction.",
      "text": "Incorrect. It means higher abstraction."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480779992cfa387265267",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Confusion 3: Inversion means execution order reversed",
      "text": "Confusion 3: Inversion means execution order reversed"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54803085b3c608ea2bdc17",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Incorrect. Control flow remains the same.",
      "text": "Incorrect. Control flow remains the same."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480379997ffa128802ae4",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Only dependency direction changes.",
      "text": "Only dependency direction changes."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809db840c32f18cfa9d3",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Confusion 4: Service is higher because it runs first",
      "text": "Confusion 4: Service is higher because it runs first"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54806d9194d210c69293d8",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Incorrect. It is higher because it defines policy.",
      "text": "Incorrect. It is higher because it defines policy."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548055a9dcef5204d8a30c",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548035921ffcaf89081087",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "10. One Sentence Summary",
      "text": "10. One Sentence Summary"
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a4bcd3ddf08fe49f89",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Dependency Injection is about how dependencies are provided.",
      "text": "Dependency Injection is about how dependencies are provided."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548090b607ca587ecc7247",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Dependency Inversion is about who depends on whom.",
      "text": "Dependency Inversion is about who depends on whom."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed548031ae78fa75b3d9fa6e",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Higher-level means more abstract policy.",
      "text": "Higher-level means more abstract policy."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed54809daf25c9f93b7c56b9",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Inner means core architectural position.",
      "text": "Inner means core architectural position."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480c38c78dc350cd30150",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "In Clean Architecture, higher-level modules live in inner layers, and lower-level modules live in outer layers, with dependencies always pointing inward.",
      "text": "In Clean Architecture, higher-level modules live in inner layers, and lower-level modules live in outer layers, with dependencies always pointing inward."
    },
    {
      "id": "31124eb1ed5480a3ae53f952e53002e4",
      "type": "divider"
    }
  ]
}
